[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0010","text":"……凛世，从那里能看到什么吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0020","text":"…………Producer先生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0030","text":"……是的\n等待着开幕的……大家的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0040","text":"热情…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0050","text":"嗯，大家都在等着凛世们\n让我们创造最棒的舞台吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0060","text":"……好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0070","text":"为了回应……大家的心意……\n我会用心歌唱"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0080","text":"嗯，就是这股劲头\n我记得你的朋友也会来吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0090","text":"——好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0100","text":"……希望能看到呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21201000_03_0005","text":"Motion"}]
